	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">At it's most basic, the why is just a goal to make the world a better place, to touch and improve lives. Many are trying to solve problems that the modern world has through developing new technology. While there is definitely a need for that, I think the deeper need we face is to reach within, to understand and improve ourselves as people, and more, as a society. </p>
